{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":false,\"why\":\"S01-B2确实支持“因为在意某件事而迟疑/谨慎”，但待评解释把原因具体化成了“愿望比平日允许自己的更深”“过去总能及时收手”“管得住欲望”。这些关于人物平日的自我限制、过去反复收手的习惯和欲望控制史，在当前没有任何历史可依据，本段听感也没有建立。尤其S01-B2给出的具体因果其实是：太清楚想说什么，并意识到一旦说出会改变关系，所以谨慎；待评解释没有沿用这个已建立原因，而依赖了新编的前提。因此不是单纯解释得少，而是核心推导依赖未建立的人物前史。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S01-B1：开头两下响亮和弦的突然迸发、光点缓落后仍悬着、船歌的稳定摇荡尚未建立\",\"S01-B2：尚未解释“因为知道话一旦说出会改变关系，所以反而谨慎”这一已给出的具体原因\",\"S01-B3：刚踏上船板时的微晃、瞬间失重，以及尚未安稳进入规律水浪的感觉\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a7fb482f-203e-45dc-8a27-6937eb01f0b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045452823592Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.11, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:00.936296+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "513e88dba361d3c58e6d8e2d2c8f5708ac27d4601d44dab08934037e88987153", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000